 R←Test_Dir2_032(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;noOf
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method recursively with a restrictive file pattern
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list←1⊃('recurse' 1)('type'(0 1 2 3 4))##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 ∆Home,'/file_*'

 :If 'Win'≡APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     noOf←≢⎕CMD'dir /S /B ',∆Home,'\file_*'
 :Else
     noOf←≢⎕SH'find -L ',∆Home,' -name "file_*"'
 :EndIf
 →T.PassesIf noOf=+/##.FilesAndDirs.IsFile list

 R←T._OK
